2/10/2026 
Aim: start with normalisation 
report:understood handmarkerResult
notes:
    HandLandmarkerResult
├── handedness              List[List[Category]]
├── hand_landmarks          List[List[NormalizedLandmark]]   # image-normalized
└── hand_world_landmarks    List[List[Landmark]]             # meters, world space
# wrong
ANM.generation.hand_landmarks.NormalizedLandmark[1]

# right
ANM.generation.hand_landmarks[0][1]          # landmark 1 of first hand
ANM.generation.hand_landmarks[0][1].x        # its x
ANM.generation.handedness[0][0].category_name  # "Left" / "Right"
ANM.generation.hand_world_landmarks[0][0]    # wrist in world space

